# csharp-render-structured-buffer 任务 4.1 证据：双后端像素、三种负向与八份报告对账
记录时间：2026-11-04 17:20
只追加，不覆盖。八条运行命令由主 agent 代跑（执行者准备命令与步骤）。

## A. 生成八份报告的命令与退出码（先删旧同名报告再跑）
```powershell
cd E:\Projects\CascadedEngine
$exe = 'out\build\x64-debug\bin\GPUBackendTester.exe'
Remove-Item test_output\csharp_structured_buffer_*.json -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
& $exe --backend d3d12 --test TestCSharpStructuredBuffer --headless 10 --report test_output\csharp_structured_buffer_d3d12_normal.json
& $exe --backend vulkan --test TestCSharpStructuredBuffer --headless 10 --report test_output\csharp_structured_buffer_vulkan_normal.json
$env:CASCADED_CSHARP_SB_SELFTEST='bad-buffer-color'
& $exe --backend d3d12 --test TestCSharpStructuredBuffer --headless 10 --report test_output\csharp_structured_buffer_d3d12_bad-buffer-color.json
& $exe --backend vulkan --test TestCSharpStructuredBuffer --headless 10 --report test_output\csharp_structured_buffer_vulkan_bad-buffer-color.json
$env:CASCADED_CSHARP_SB_SELFTEST='unbound-field'
& $exe --backend d3d12 --test TestCSharpStructuredBuffer --headless 10 --report test_output\csharp_structured_buffer_d3d12_unbound-field.json
& $exe --backend vulkan --test TestCSharpStructuredBuffer --headless 10 --report test_output\csharp_structured_buffer_vulkan_unbound-field.json
$env:CASCADED_CSHARP_SB_SELFTEST='bad-buffer-name'
& $exe --backend d3d12 --test TestCSharpStructuredBuffer --headless 10 --report test_output\csharp_structured_buffer_d3d12_bad-buffer-name.json
& $exe --backend vulkan --test TestCSharpStructuredBuffer --headless 10 --report test_output\csharp_structured_buffer_vulkan_bad-buffer-name.json
Remove-Item Env:\CASCADED_CSHARP_SB_SELFTEST
```
退出码原文（`test_output\sb_runs.txt`）：
```
RUN d3d12 normal EXIT=0
RUN vulkan normal EXIT=0
RUN d3d12 bad-buffer-color EXIT=1
RUN vulkan bad-buffer-color EXIT=1
RUN d3d12 unbound-field EXIT=1
RUN vulkan unbound-field EXIT=1
RUN d3d12 bad-buffer-name EXIT=1
RUN vulkan bad-buffer-name EXIT=1
```

